  "id": "cider-pulled-pork-with-apple-slaw",
  "name": "Cider Pulled Pork with Apple Slaw",
  "subtitle": "Slow-roasted pork rolls with crisp apple and dill slaw",
  "description": "Pork shoulder is coated with a smoky spice mixture, roasted with cider and onions until tender, then shredded and served in toasted rolls with creamy apple slaw.",
